# Base URL of the populrbackend service (Railway), no trailing slash.
# Baked in at BUILD time by Vite — set this in Railway's service variables
# before/at deploy, not just at runtime, or the build won't pick it up.
#
# Example: https://populrbackend-production.up.railway.app
#
# When unset, the app falls back to a fully local/simulated connect flow
# (no real Instagram OAuth) so it still runs standalone in dev.
VITE_API_URL=
